{"title":"Career Roadmap · Policy Associate","role":"Policy Associate","summary":"A Policy Associate researches laws, regulations, public programmes and social or economic issues, then converts evidence into practical policy recommendations.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law - LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Consumer Protection / Health Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Policy Associate researches laws, regulations, public programmes and social or economic issues, then converts evidence into practical policy recommendations."},{"type":"p","text":"For a student specializing in Consumer Protection / Health Law, the role can focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Consumer rights"},{"text":"Healthcare regulation"},{"text":"Patient rights"},{"text":"Health-system governance"},{"text":"Pharmaceutical regulation"},{"text":"Medical devices"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Digital health"},{"text":"Public health"},{"text":"Healthcare access"},{"text":"Health-tech regulation"},{"text":"Consumer-facing healthcare services"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Law","Policy Research","Data","Healthcare/Consumer Knowledge","Stakeholder Engagement"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential employers include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government departments"},{"text":"Regulatory institutions"},{"text":"Public-policy organizations"},{"text":"Think tanks"},{"text":"Healthcare organizations"},{"text":"Consumer organizations"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Research institutions"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Healthcare companies"},{"text":"Insurance organizations"},{"text":"Health-tech companies"},{"text":"International development organizations"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB","Consumer Protection + Health Law